  {
   "id": "cap-bcl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": -1510,
   "width": 2900,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "routed experts (69×384) **20.84B** (50.9%) · attention + router + L0 FFN **19.18B** (46.8%) · lm head **937.4M** (2.3%) · embed **0** (row lookup) · MTP ×3 **0** (only when drafting) · ViT + merger **0** (runs per image / frame) · audio encoder **0** (runs per audio clip)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": -1420,
   "width": 1400,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "# MiMo-V2.6-Pro — model  \nRead top → bottom. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.06 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all the same size; where the parameters and the compute live is the pair of bars above. T = sequence length. Zoom in: *Layer* tab = one decoder layer.    \nSource: HF `XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Pro-RL` config.json, modeling_mimo_v2.py, dflash/ and safetensors headers."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 160,
   "y": -1420,
   "width": 1440,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "Layer rows — **SWA** (60): sliding window 128 tokens, 128 Q / 8 KV heads, learned per-head sink logit, RoPE θ 1e+04 · **GA** (10): global causal attention, 128 Q / 8 KV heads, RoPE θ 1e+07 (1M context) · **L0** is GA with a dense FFN.    \nEvery other layer: MoE, 384 routed experts, top-8, sigmoid router, no shared expert. MoE layer ≈ **14.77B**, 98% of all layer weights are routed experts. Pattern: L0 GA · (6 SWA, GA) · (7 SWA, GA) ×6 · (6 SWA, GA) ×2."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-flash",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": -1140,
   "width": 1300,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "**Pro vs Flash** (same modeling code, same ViT / audio / DFlash designs with outputs widened to 6144; only sizes differ):    \nlayers 70 vs 48 (60 SWA + 10 GA vs 39 + 9) · hidden 6144 vs 4096 · Q heads 128 vs 64 · GA KV heads 8 vs 4 (Pro's GA layers use the SWA head layout) · routed experts 384 vs 256 (both top-8, expert width 2048) · v scale 0.612 vs 0.707 · DFlash taps L0, L15, L31, L47, L69 vs L0, L11, L23, L35, L47 · stored 1024.22B vs 310.8B, active 40.96B vs 14.8B."
  },
  {
