   "x": -680,
   "y": 2602,
   "width": 40,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl49",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1270,
   "y": 2592,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`draft token t+2 … ×3 chained modules`"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-mtp",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -970,
   "y": 2646,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**3 MTP modules** (`model.mtp.layers.0–2`, 1.93B, in `model_mtp.safetensors`) ship in the main checkpoint (config.json has no `num_nextn_predict_layers`; the count is read off tensor names); the HF modeling code skips them (`_keys_to_ignore_on_load_unexpected`) — serving engines use them as the EAGLE-style draft head (the README's SGLang recipe: `--enable-multi-layer-eagle`, 3 steps)."
  },
  {
   "id": "dcat50",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 2190,
   "width": 1200,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl51",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2520,
   "y": 2180,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`concat outputs of L0, L15, L31, L47, L69  [T, 30720]` — bar clipped (real 1843px)"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-tap0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 330,
   "y": -714,
   "width": 230,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "↳ output of L0 → DFlash"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-tap15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 330,
   "y": -114,
   "width": 230,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "↳ output of L15 → DFlash"
  },
  {
