   "x": 330,
   "y": 526,
   "width": 230,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "↳ output of L31 → DFlash"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-tap47",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 330,
   "y": 1166,
   "width": 230,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "↳ output of L47 → DFlash"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-tap69",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 330,
   "y": 2046,
   "width": 230,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "↳ output of L69 → DFlash"
  },
  {
   "id": "dfc52",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1750,
   "y": 2244,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 76,
   "text": "**fc** 30720 → 6144 + RMSNorm  \n= context K/V for the drafter",
   "color": "#a3e635"
  },
  {
   "id": "dblk53",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1750,
   "y": 2360,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 76,
   "text": "**block of 8**: last token + 7 [MASK]  \n→ embed_tokens (shared)",
   "color": "#a3e635"
  },
  {
   "id": "ddr54",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1750,
   "y": 2476,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 96,
   "text": "**DFlash drafter** ×5 layers  \nSWA 1024, non-causal in block  \n2.77B · separate file",
   "color": "#a3e635"
  },
  {
   "id": "dhead55",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1750,
   "y": 2612,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**lm_head** (shared)",
   "color": "#a3e635"
  },
  {
   "id": "dids56",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1880,
   "y": 2708,
   "width": 40,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl57",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2070,
   "y": 2698,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`7 draft tokens in one pass`"
  },
  {
   "id": "dver58",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1750,
   "y": 2762,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 76,
   "text": "**verify**: target runs all 7 drafts  \nin ONE forward pass",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-dflash",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1750,
   "y": 2878,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "`dflash/` (2.77B, Qwen3-style layers, 128 Q / 8 KV heads of 128). Each draft layer attends to [context K/V ; block K/V]; the README calls it a \"5-layer SWA MTP drafter (DFlash-style)\" that predicts 7 subsequent tokens per forward pass."
  }
